{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-03-29 08:00:00', 'title': 'SANDRA PIANALTO TO CONCLUDE SERVICE TO FIRSTENERGY BOARD OF DIRECTORS; MELVIN WILLIAMS NOMINATED FOR ELECTION AT THE 2021 ANNUAL MEETING', 'text': "AKRON, OHIO, MARCH 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SANDRA PIANALTO, A MEMBER OF THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS SINCE 2018, HAS DECIDED NOT TO STAND FOR RE-ELECTION AT THE COMPANY'S 2021 ANNUAL MEETING IN ORDER TO FOCUS ON OTHER COMMITMENTS. THE BOARD HAS NOMINATED MELVIN D."}